silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_05_federation_olog_register_concrete_anchor_vet_record_entry a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors.sections.05_federation_olog_register.concrete_anchor.vet_record_entry" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_05_federation_olog_register_concrete_anchor_vet_record_entry silm:hasLongDescription "The VetRecord_Mittens_RegistryEntry is The first entry in FedReg_Mittens is the pair (VetRecord_Mittens, lambda_evidence). VetRecord_Mittens is the typed object; lambda_evidence is the aboutness arrow to Mittens. This entry enables observability of Mittens via the physical vet record." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_05_federation_olog_register_concrete_anchor_storage_packet_entry a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors.sections.05_federation_olog_register.concrete_anchor.storage_packet_entry" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_05_federation_olog_register_concrete_anchor_storage_packet_entry silm:hasLongDescription "The StoragePacket_Mittens_RegistryEntry is The second entry is (StoragePacket_Mittens, lambda_storage). The storage packet is a typed wrapper around stored vet data; lambda_storage is its aboutness arrow to Mittens. This entry enables observability via the storage topology." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_05_federation_olog_register_concrete_anchor_register_node a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors.sections.05_federation_olog_register.concrete_anchor.register_node" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_05_federation_olog_register_concrete_anchor_register_node silm:hasLongDescription "The FedReg_Mittens is FedReg_Mittens is the register node — the typed container holding all four (object, aboutness-arrow) pairs for Mittens. It is not an object about Mittens; it is the index of objects that are about Mittens." .
